    <string name="subcategory3_name">Math and Geometry Formulas\n (Free)</string>
    <string name="subcategory3_desc_1">An AMAZING APPLICATION that you will always have with you, preventing you from getting lost among formulas in books.</string>
    <string name="subcategory3_desc_2">This application contains ALL Math and Geometry Formulas taught in high school and middle school. \n
        Unlike other formula applications,\n
        ALL Math and Geometry formulas are shown on full pages.\n
        You can also ZOOM in on the formulas with two fingers.
    </string>
    <string name="subcategory3_desc_3">The application includes Math and Geometry Formulas.\n
        First, you choose the subject: Math or Geometry?\n
        Then all the topics taught in middle and high school related to the chosen subject are listed.\n
        When you select the topic, all formulas related to that topic appear.\n
        You can swipe between formulas and enlarge the page with two fingers.\n
    </string>

    <string name="subcategory4_name">Physics Formulas\n (Free)</string>
    <string name="subcategory4_desc_1">An AMAZING APPLICATION that you will always have with you, preventing you from getting lost among formulas in books.</string>
    <string name="subcategory4_desc_2">This application contains ALL PHYSICS Formulas taught in high school and middle school. \n
        Unlike other formula applications,\n
        ALL Physics formulas are shown on full pages.\n
        You can also ZOOM in on the formulas with two fingers.</string>
    <string name="subcategory4_desc_3">The application includes Physics Formulas and Topic Summaries.\n
        When you open the application, all the topics related to Physics taught in middle and high school are listed.\n
        When you select the topic, all formulas related to that topic appear.\n
        You can swipe between formulas and enlarge the page with two fingers.\n</string>

    <string name="subcategory5_name">I\'m Not Afraid of Derivatives \n (Free)</string>
    <string name="subcategory5_desc_1"><b>YOU NO LONGER NEED TO BE AFRAID OF DERIVATIVES</b>\n
        With the hierarchical learning method, you can now easily LEARN derivatives.</string>
    <string name="subcategory5_desc_2">To facilitate learning, Derivatives were first divided into Units. Each Unit was then subdivided into smaller goals by breaking down the subheadings,\n
        The step-by-step learning method was applied with Subject Explanation, Solved Problems, One ME One YOU, Mini Quizzes, Homework Tests, and more TEST sections in each Unit.\n
        </string>
    <string name="subcategory5_desc_3">For complete and SOLID learning from the basics, it was required to complete the previous Units before starting each new Unit.</string>

    <string name="subcategory6_name">Riddle Garden \n (Free)</string>
    <string name="subcategory6_desc_1">2000 Riddles and Brain Teasers in 5 categories at your fingertips. No need to search the internet.</string>
    <string name="subcategory6_desc_2">All riddles are always at your fingertips without requiring an internet connection.\n
        Riddles suitable for all levels from easy to hard, from elementary school to university.
    </string>
    <string name="subcategory6_desc_3">Looking for entertaining riddles to ask your friends, family, and loved ones?\n
        Here are 2000 special and selected riddles and brain teasers.\n
        <b>Application Features:</b>\n
        # Does not require internet.\n
        # You can save the riddles you like as favorite riddles.\n
        # You can continue from where you left off in each category.\n
        # You can share with all social messaging apps.\n\n

        <b>Application Content:</b>\n
        # Children\'s Riddles\n
        # Silly Riddles\n
        # Riddles with Punchlines\n
        # Brain Teasers\n
        # Hard Riddles</string>

    <string name="subcategory7_name">Three Operation Competition \n (Free)</string>
    <string name="subcategory7_desc_1">You answer the mathematical operations (addition, subtraction, and multiplication) asked within 60 seconds.\n
    In this game where you also race against time, the game ends when you give a wrong answer or the 60-second time limit is over.</string>
    <string name="subcategory7_desc_2">The remaining time is seen at the top of the screen. Each correct answer earns you points.
        Play 3 operations to improve your quick thinking and decision-making skills. Play the 3 operations game and learn math perfectly.
        Those who wish can choose and play the three operations according to their level: beginner, intermediate, or expert.\n
        The unlimited number of operations allows students to constantly develop themselves with different problems.</string>
    <string name="subcategory7_desc_3">The three-operation math application has an unlimited number of operations.
        This allows students to have the opportunity to solve different questions each time.
        Even if they know the three operations, they can continuously practice to increase their operation speed.\n \n
        <b>The game consists of 3 levels. </b>\n
        In the first level, numbers from 1 to 10 are used. This program is very suitable and enjoyable for children who want to learn the multiplication table.
        It also offers the opportunity to break their own records for adults since it is a race against time.
        This game will increase your operational ability, attention, and concentration, and develop Brain-Hand coordination.\n
        In the second level, numbers from 1 to 15 are used,\n
        In the third level, numbers from 1 to 20 are used.\n \n
        An enjoyable and math and intelligence-enhancing game for your free time.
    </string>

    <string name="subcategory8_name">Tic-Tac-Toe (Three Stones) \n (Free)</string>
    <string name="subcategory8_desc_1">The Tic-Tac-Toe game, which we call three-in-a-row or three stones in Turkish.\n
        Play Tic Tac Toe on your Android phone. No need for paper to play puzzle games anymore!
        You can now play Tic Tac Toe for free on your Android device.
</string>
    <string name="subcategory8_desc_2">The Tic-Tac-Toe game is also known as Noughts and Crosses,
        also called three-in-a-row in Turkish.\n
        Tic-tac-toe (American English), noughts and crosses (British English).
        This game was first found on a dam tile dating back to 1300 BC.
        In Roman history, an early variation of tic-tac-toe was played around the first century BC.
</string>
    <string name="subcategory8_desc_3">The Tic Tac Toe game is also known as Cross and O\'s or simply X\'s and O\'s.
        In the free Tic Tac Toe application, you can play against artificial intelligence or your friends.
        One player plays X, the other player plays O, and they take turns marking the spaces in the 3×3 grid.
        The player who manages to place three of their marks in a horizontal, vertical, or diagonal row wins the game.
        In the next game, the winner of the previous game is the player who starts the game. If no one wins, the game ends in a draw.\n
        Playing Tic Tac Toe helps improve your problem-solving and strategic thinking skills.
        Start playing free Tic Tac Toe on your mobile device now.
        Download the free Tic Tac Toe app now and let the fun begin!
</string>

